((TargetObject = /*Classes\\ActivatableClasses\\Package\\Microsoft.*/i and TargetObject = /.*\\DebugPath/i) or (TargetObject = /*\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\PackagedAppXDebug\\Microsoft.*/i and TargetObject = /.*\\(Default)/i))
